# Responsive art derivatives — GENERATED by
# scripts/generate-image-derivatives.mjs on `prebuild`, never committed.
# 347 sources x 2 widths is ~56 MB, and public/ is tracked, so committing them
# would put that in every clone.
#
# The MANIFEST beside them (src/lib/artDerivatives.generated.json, ~16 KB) IS
# committed on purpose: artSrcSet.ts imports it, so tsc and vitest need it to
# exist in a fresh clone that has never run a build.
public/_derived/
